{
    "2024.acl-long.652_s01": "The datasets utilized in our experiments were all in English, thus our evaluation only encompasses the English language.",
    "2024.acl-long.652_s02": "We did not assess whether similar issues exist for large language models in other languages such as Chinese, French, and various other languages."
